sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant C as CategoryBarChart
    participant M as MetricsPage
    participant D as DistributionTaskDrawer
    participant API as api.getDashboardTasks
    participant S as dashboard.service
    participant A as portfolioAgg

    U->>C: 点击某档柱体 / footer 图例
    C->>C: onItemClick / 图例 onClick → onDrill(r.key)
    C->>M: onDrill(key)
    M->>M: openDist(title, dim) → 组装 query（scope + 筛选 + 维度）
    M->>D: open=true + title + query（受控渲染）
    D->>D: useEffect(open) → setPage(1) → load(1)
    D->>API: getDashboardTasks({ ...query, page: 1, pageSize: 8 })
    API->>S: GET /api/dashboard/tasks?scope=...&priority=P0&page=1&pageSize=8
    S->>S: normalizeQuery(query) → q
    S->>S: resolveScope(me, q.scope) → scope
    S->>S: listScopedItems(db, q, me, scope) → items
    S->>S: resolveDimension(query) → { kind, value }
    S->>S: 基数 = taskStatus ? listScopeAllLeafTasks : listScopeLeafTasks
    S->>A: overdueBucketOf(todayStr, dueDate)（overdueBucket 档过滤）
    S->>S: 行组装 + projectName 映射 + 排序 + paged
    S-->>API: { items, total, page, pageSize }
    API-->>D: Paged~DashboardTaskRow~
    D->>D: 渲染 DataTable（7 列 + 空/错/加载态）
    D->>U: 行点击 → navigate(ROUTES.projectWbs(row.projectId))
    D->>D: 翻页 onChange(page) → load(page)（重新局部拉取）
